arted playing, I couldn't get the controls to function properly, but it seemed to work when I reset the controls to default in the options menu. I look forward to getting deeper in this game and trying out the later installments in the series .", "timestamp_created": 1752954211, "timestamp_updated": 1752954211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200128817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091756904", "personaname": "Schnee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/derschnee/", "num_games_owned": 2647, "num_reviews": 208, "playtime_forever": 55, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 55, "last_played": 1420933564, "avatar": "586199024452561c6234eaa697413eaf6163da1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fuxk 2K!", "timestamp_created": 1752898482, "timestamp_updated": 1752898482, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497215807437896729", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199960620", "author": {"steamid": "76561198881395768", "personaname": "Hollow Kane", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hollowkane/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 979, "playtime_forever": 1273, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1273, "last_played": 1752694506, "avatar": "cfcc7d1b28b089d3b85b02f2ece7b7dc96958caa"}, "language": "english", "review": "8/10", "timestamp_created": 1752694738, "timestamp_updated": 1752694738, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote